  conditional only on the listed premises); <strong|input> (stated premise
  produced elsewhere); <strong|cited> (external literature, hypotheses
  checked in the chapter). "Producer" names the package that owns the
  producing chapter according to <verbatim|coverage-inventory.json> at
  <verbatim|9d11cca>. A producer entry is an assignment of responsibility,
  not a claim that the producer has delivered or that the statements have
  been matched on both sides. Every edge below remains open until the
  producer acknowledges it and the independent reviewer agrees.

